      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'll try the vitamin K. but i'm still a bit nervous about the stomach thing. the pain in my upper abdomen is getting sharper, almost like a burning sensation, and i've been feeling a little dizzy when i stand up too fast. do you think i could just double up on the advil to 1000mg or so at a time to really knock out that pain? and is the dizziness just from not eating enough because my stomach hurts?",
